  "adaptations": [
    "Public color matching substitutes private CGColorTransformCreate/ConvertColorComponents only at the color-space conversion boundary. Values near name classification thresholds require bounded original/public conversion comparison; no claim of all ICC profiles equivalence.",
    "AXColorStringForColor returns nil when no color name is available, rather than passing nil to native stringWithString:. If public getRed fails for an otherwise named color it omits luma instead of inventing a numeric value.",
    "Original cached NSNumberFormatter captures its default locale on first use; this behavior is retained.",
    "The15.5 binary requests key blue green, absent from all39 original resource tables. Native literal-key fallback is preserved. Existing green cyan translations are not substituted.",
    "Localization is recovered language data from the named system runtime; this manifest does not assert an independent redistribution license.",
    "Existing Grid labels, Spectrum active/selected value, native favorite labels and manager favorite values consume the recovered name+luma; original interaction and selected traits are unchanged."
  ],
